{
  "$comment": [
    "示例清单：展示两种内置源与各自的参数。",
    "真正生效的是 config/sources.json（路径由 settings.sources.manifest_path 决定，",
    "可用环境变量 RAG4C_SOURCES_MANIFEST_PATH 覆盖）。",
    "新增一种源类型（Context7 / S3 / Confluence …）只需写一个类 + 一行注册，",
    "见 sources/plugins.py；清单格式与本文件完全一致，不必改任何代码。"
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "name": "my-github-docs",
      "type": "github_repo",
      "dataset_id": "kb-mygithub",
      "tenant_id": "",
      "enabled": true,
      "metadata": {
        "project": "示例项目",
        "lang": "zh-CN"
      },
      "params": {
        "repo": "owner/name",
        "ref": "main",
        "include": ["docs/**"],
        "exclude": ["docs/archive/**"],
        "extensions": [".md", ".mdx"],
        "strip_prefix": "docs/",
        "mode": "auto",
        "max_files": 0,
        "timeout": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "my-local-docs",
      "type": "local_dir",
      "dataset_id": "kb-local",
      "enabled": false,
      "metadata": {
        "project": "本地资料"
      },
      "params": {
        "path": "D:/some/where/docs",
        "include": ["**/*.md"],
        "exclude": ["**/draft/**"],
        "extensions": [".md", ".txt"],
        "max_files": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
